        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heavy fuel oil, burned in power plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heavy fuel oil, burned in power plant
Some data for air emissions in the country. The data were partly given aggregated for oil and gas use.;
UUID: 08a38074-2af8-373c-a5aa-15740ed29a50
All energy use, use of chemicals, emissions to air and water including treatment of flue gasses and effluents.
Location: Estimation for the country.
Technology: Estimation for average technology.
Time period: Some statistical and environmental data for 2000 for some companies, other data for Europe.
Production volume: 0.3 TWh from power plants and 2.4 TWh from combined cycle plants.
Sampling: Literature, environmental reports and questionnaires 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_08a38074-2af8-373c-a5aa-15740ed29a50.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
